      "AUTOCALL PERF block checks: valid perf types, ratio/diff types require a 2-asset basket, non-negative bonus/lower/one-star/autocall-coupon values, lower strike <= strike, one-star/long basket only on notes, dividend columns equal size with allowed underlyings, ascending dates, non-negative amounts, ex-date calendar/shifter set when enabled"
